# Project Conventions

## Not for Work

This project should **not** be used for work. It is for personal, learning, or experimental use only.

## No Git

Do **not** connect this project to git. Do not run `git init`, add remotes, or push to repositories.

## Terminal Commands

When running multiple commands, **do not chain them with `&&`**. Use separate commands instead.

```bash
# ❌ Avoid
cd "c:\Users\olive\Desktop\Openclaw" && npm install

# ✅ Use separate commands
cd "c:\Users\olive\Desktop\Openclaw"
npm install
```
